# local CLI caches created by probing edit_exists CLIs during audit/dev
.opencode/

# Consensus-gate working files: review inputs and reports are per-session
# scaffolding, not deliverables.
.consensus/

# Gate and handoff trail. Ephemeral, per-session, and full of pool/model ids that
# rotate on every run — `.claude/artifacts/kiro-trust-fs-write/` reached main with
# 38 of them before this line existed. Outcome and verdict belong in the PR and in
# openspec/; the identity of who reviewed does not belong in the repo at all.
.claude/artifacts/
.claude/handoffs/
.claude/worktrees/
